  "description": "If you're after a Thai curry without the heat, this veggie version is for you! It's still full of flavour too, thanks to peanutty tofu,\nzingy ginger paste, mild red curry paste and creamy coconut milk. Don't forget to add the peanuts for crunch, and a squeeze of lime to cut the richness.\nThe current labour shortages have impacted availability of ingredients across the entire food supply chain. As such, what you receive may be slightly different to what’s pictured. Don’t worry, your recipe will be just as delicious!",
